 "inference": [
  "The UH-79's Battle Royale health of 1250 is stored in Affector_UH60VehicleHealthOverride_F2P, equal to EA's figure; this settles the open item of L3358. The same mechanism gives Battle Royale tanks 800 and IFVs 750 against 1200 in multiplayer (L3334). 'F2P' is taken as the free-to-play Battle Royale mode from the UH-79 match.",
  "Each override carries 200 in Field_6f28bf9c. In the single-player modifiers that field is a fifth to a quarter of the health, which fits a critical-health threshold; unnamed, so a candidate.",
  "The multiplayer disabled-state regeneration affector holds 0.25 in Field_cbf2ad7c and no health. If that is the regeneration multiplier while critical it means slowed by 75%, not EA's 80%; a file-only value that may be older than EA's note, or a different quantity. Not recorded as the slowdown.",
  "Single-player modifiers are listed for completeness and do not apply to multiplayer pages."
 ],
